{"id": "8th-u2-q273", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "grammar", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "hard", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "8", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "full_year", "unit_id": "ta-8th-u2-iyarkai", "lesson_id": "lesson-11-thirukkural", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "ta-8th-u2-grammar-nedunther-join", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "'நெடுமை + தேர்' என்பதனைச் சேர்த்து எழுதக் கிடைக்கும் சொல் எது?"}], "options": {"A": "நெடுந்தேர்", "B": "நெடுந்தேர்", "C": "நெடுத்தேர்", "D": "நெடுமைத்தேர்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் பக்கம் 46 மதிப்பீடு வினா 4: 'நெடுமை + தேர்' என்பதில் 'ஈறுபோதல்' விதியால் 'மை' கெட்டு நெடு + தேர் என்றாகி, 'இனமிகல்' விதியால் தகர மெல்லின ஒற்று 'ந்' தோன்றி 'நெடுந்தேர்' என்றாகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Which combined form is obtained by joining 'Nedumai + Thaer' under Tamil grammar rules?"}], "options": {"A": "நெடுந்தேர்", "B": "நெடுந்தேர்", "C": "நெடுத்தேர்", "D": "நெடுமைத்தேர்"}, "explanation": "Textbook page 46 evaluation question 4: 'நெடுமை + தேர்' drops 'மை' via Eerupothal and gains the homorganic nasal 'ந்' before 'த்' via Inamigal, resulting in நெடுந்தேர். Option A is correct."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "8", "term": "full_year", "ed